---
source: crates/tungstate-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Take a file or folder off every member, for good.

The one deletion that sticks: without --exact a file deleted by hand is copied back, and this is how to say it was meant.

Usage: tungstate sync forget [OPTIONS] <NAME> <PATH>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          The sync

  <PATH>
          A file or folder, as the preview lists it

Options:
      --yes
          Do not stop to confirm

      --json
          

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
